                            <comment id="16405808" author="vsisko" created="Tue, 20 Mar 2018 04:54:48 +0000"  >&lt;p&gt;Implemented changes in ignite-web-console.&lt;/p&gt;
{bat|sh}
&lt;p&gt; for Java 9 support.&lt;/p&gt;</comment>
                            <comment id="16407443" author="pkonstantinov" created="Wed, 21 Mar 2018 04:25:08 +0000"  >&lt;p&gt;Tested on Windows&lt;br/&gt;
Failed under Mac. Failed to check Java version.&lt;br/&gt;
We have to use another condition &apos;JAVA_VER=`&quot;$JAVA&quot; -version 2&amp;gt;&amp;amp;1 | egrep &quot;1\.&lt;span class=&quot;error&quot;&gt;&amp;#91;78&amp;#93;&lt;/span&gt;\.|9\.*&quot;`&apos;&lt;br/&gt;
Due to &apos;java -version&apos; returns 9.x.x&lt;br/&gt;
The same issue under Ubuntu&lt;/p&gt;</comment>
                            <comment id="16421970" author="vsisko" created="Mon, 2 Apr 2018 06:38:00 +0000"  >&lt;p&gt;Fixed for UNIX systems.&lt;/p&gt;</comment>
                            <comment id="16426688" author="pkonstantinov" created="Thu, 5 Apr 2018 09:55:28 +0000"  >&lt;p&gt;Successfully started under Oracle JDK but failed under OpenJDK-9.&lt;br/&gt;
Please investigate.&lt;/p&gt;</comment>
                            <comment id="16445554" author="vsisko" created="Fri, 20 Apr 2018 09:46:41 +0000"  >&lt;p&gt;Not reproduced. Successfully started under OpenJDK 9. Please provide error information.&lt;/p&gt;</comment>
                            <comment id="16453678" author="pkonstantinov" created="Thu, 26 Apr 2018 08:25:53 +0000"  >&lt;p&gt;Web agent downloaded from docker build doesn&apos;t work.&lt;br/&gt;
We need to add support for OpenJDK in build.sh&lt;/p&gt;</comment>
                            <comment id="16627150" author="vsisko" created="Tue, 25 Sep 2018 10:53:28 +0000"  >&lt;p&gt;Merged last master with support of java 9+&lt;/p&gt;

&lt;p&gt;If issue with open JDK still reproduced please create separated issue.&lt;/p&gt;</comment>
                            <comment id="16631684" author="pkonstantinov" created="Fri, 28 Sep 2018 10:43:29 +0000"  >&lt;p&gt;Works right.&lt;/p&gt;</comment>
                            <comment id="16633671" author="pkonstantinov" created="Mon, 1 Oct 2018 07:28:17 +0000"  >&lt;p&gt;Re-tested one more time.&lt;br/&gt;
OpenJDK 8,9 works fine - officially supported.&lt;br/&gt;
Open JDK 10 - shows the warning.&lt;br/&gt;
OpenJDK 11 -  web agent doesn&apos;t work.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;div class=&quot;code panel&quot; style=&quot;border-width: 1px;&quot;&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;codeContent panelContent&quot;&gt;
&lt;pre class=&quot;code-java&quot;&gt;
WARNING:
The 11 version of JAVA installed in JAVA_HOME=/home/kope/Downloads/jdk-11/ was not tested with Apache Ignite.
Run it on your own risk or point JAVA_HOME variable to installation of JDK 1.8 or JDK 9.
You can also download JDK at http:&lt;span class=&quot;code-comment&quot;&gt;//java.com/download
&lt;/span&gt;OpenJDK 64-Bit Server VM warning: Option AggressiveOpts was deprecated in version 11.0 and will likely be removed in a &lt;span class=&quot;code-keyword&quot;&gt;future&lt;/span&gt; release.
Error occurred during initialization of boot layer
java.lang.module.FindException: Module java.xml.bind not found
&lt;/pre&gt;
&lt;/div&gt;&lt;/div&gt;</comment>
                            <comment id="16637752" author="vsisko" created="Thu, 4 Oct 2018 03:19:15 +0000"  >&lt;p&gt;Merged last changes from Ignite run files.&lt;/p&gt;</comment>
                            <comment id="16643119" author="pkonstantinov" created="Tue, 9 Oct 2018 10:59:34 +0000"  >&lt;p&gt;I faced with error in case of using openJDK 8&lt;br/&gt;
When I&apos;ve started ignite-web-agent.sh I got&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;div class=&quot;code panel&quot; style=&quot;border-width: 1px;&quot;&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;codeContent panelContent&quot;&gt;
&lt;pre class=&quot;code-java&quot;&gt;
./include/functions.sh: line 81: [: -lt: unary &lt;span class=&quot;code-keyword&quot;&gt;operator&lt;/span&gt; expected
./ignite-web-agent.sh: line 69: [: -eq: unary &lt;span class=&quot;code-keyword&quot;&gt;operator&lt;/span&gt; expected
./ignite-web-agent.sh: line 74: [: -gt: unary &lt;span class=&quot;code-keyword&quot;&gt;operator&lt;/span&gt; expected
./ignite-web-agent.sh: line 87: [: -eq: unary &lt;span class=&quot;code-keyword&quot;&gt;operator&lt;/span&gt; expected

&lt;/pre&gt;
&lt;/div&gt;&lt;/div&gt;

&lt;p&gt;in case of version 9,10 and 11 all worked well.&lt;/p&gt;</comment>
                            <comment id="16644434" author="vsisko" created="Wed, 10 Oct 2018 04:22:56 +0000"  >&lt;p&gt;It is common for Ignite warning. Can be merged.&lt;/p&gt;</comment>
                            <comment id="16645892" author="kuaw26" created="Thu, 11 Oct 2018 03:11:18 +0000"  >&lt;p&gt;Looks good to me. Merged to master &amp;amp; ignite-2.7.&lt;/p&gt;

&lt;p&gt;Warnings will be fixed in&#160;&lt;a href=&quot;https://issues.apache.org/jira/browse/IGNITE-9836&quot; title=&quot;Invalid check of ea java versions&quot; class=&quot;issue-link&quot; data-issue-key=&quot;IGNITE-9836&quot;&gt;&lt;del&gt;IGNITE-9836&lt;/del&gt;&lt;/a&gt;.&lt;/p&gt;</comment>
