&lt;/pre&gt;
&lt;/div&gt;&lt;/div&gt;</comment>
                            <comment id="16669722" author="kuaw26" created="Wed, 31 Oct 2018 08:01:15 +0000"  >&lt;p&gt;&lt;a href=&quot;https://issues.apache.org/jira/secure/ViewProfile.jspa?name=imurchenko&quot; class=&quot;user-hover&quot; rel=&quot;imurchenko&quot;&gt;imurchenko&lt;/a&gt; &amp;amp; &lt;a href=&quot;https://issues.apache.org/jira/secure/ViewProfile.jspa?name=anovikov&quot; class=&quot;user-hover&quot; rel=&quot;anovikov&quot;&gt;anovikov&lt;/a&gt; - could you fix this?&lt;/p&gt;</comment>
